 |EpisodeNumber=12
 |Title=South Florida
 |OriginalAirDate={{Start date|2006|4|3}}
 |ShortSummary=Tony figures he'll lounge poolside at his [[South Beach]] hotel for this entire episode but instead is encouraged to explore the ethnic diversity and uniqueness of [[Miami]], and [[South Florida]]: from [[Little Haiti]] to the [[Everglades]] to [[Key West]] and [[Little Havana]].
}}
