 |ShortSummary=Tony meets famous Peruvian chef [[Gastón Acurio]], tries [[Ceviche|Peruvian Ceviche]] and goes sightseeing in the capital city, [[Lima]]. Then he travels to a village in [[Tambopata National Reserve|Tambopata]], the Peruvian jungle, and tries piranhas and goes through unique experiences. Finally he visits the city of [[Cusco]] to try new stuff in a local market and [[Machu Picchu]], where he tries to find peace of mind.
