 |ShortSummary=Bourdain visits [[Los Angeles]], in search of the local culture, away from the glitz and glamor of [[Hollywood (film industry)|Hollywood]]. He dines at [[Roscoe's House of Chicken and Waffles|Roscoe's Chicken and Waffles]] with writer and screenwriter [[Jerry Stahl]]. He meets a women's [[roller derby]] team, and has [[French dip sandwich]]es with them at [[Philippe's]], which claims to have invented the French dip sandwich. He eats at a Mexican restaurant with a [[mariachi]] band, and visits the neighborhood of [[Thai Town, Los Angeles|Thai Town]]. Bourdain trains with the [[Hawthorne, California|Hawthorne]] [[SWAT]] team.
}}
{{Episode list
