===Season 4===
As with Season 3, Season 4 was aired in two parts: nine episodes in the winter of 2008, and ten in the summer of 2008. Various sources have referred to the summer episodes as Season 5, but in a post on his blog regarding the September 1, 2008 episode, Bourdain refers to it as the final episode of Season 4.<ref name="Goodbye">Bourdain, Anthony (1 September 2008). [http://blog.travelchannel.com/anthony-bourdain/read/goodbye-to-all-that/ Goodbye to all that]. Travel Channel.</ref>  One special episode followed the regular 2008 episodes.

