''No Reservations: Around the World on an Empty Stomach'' is a 2007 companion book to the show. Written by Bourdain, it serves as a [[scrap book]] of the previous three seasons of the television show and has extensive photographs of Bourdain and his crew at work filming the series.<ref name="Vail Daily">{{cite news | first=Larry | last=Ebersole|  title=Anthony Bourdain offers more depth to TV show travels in new book | date=2007-11-18 |  url =http://www.vaildaily.com/article/20071118/AE/71116042/0/FRONTPAGE | work =Vail Daily | access-date = 2010-06-14 }}</ref>

